resources.description:
Data used as Input for GNN and SVM predictions. This includes multiple types of datafiles: 
- Export_Dexeldata
Contains all timesteps from the simulation (rows) and for each time step the name of the active tool and a list of the follwoging data for each cut dexel serparted by semicolon:
1. direction (0 = x-direction, 1 = y-direction, 2 = z-direction)
2. Index
3. ExtenderIndex
4. True/False if the dexel was created in this timestep
5. dexel Startpoint X-Coordinate
6. dexel Startpoint Y-Coordinate
7. dexel Startpoint Z-Coordinate
8. dexel Endpoint X-Coordinate
9. dexel Endpoint Y-Coordinate
10. dexel Endpoint Z-Coordinate
11. Tool engagement depth (startpoint)
11. Tool engagement depth (endpoint)

- TimeIndexExport
List of timeindices from the simulation and the corresponding Extenderindices which were modified in this timestep. 
- TimeSeries
List of timeindices from the simulation and the corresponding simulation or process data 
- Dexelcore
Export of all dexel in the workpiece model at a given time and their associated data
Direction; Index; ExtenderID; DexelNewlyCreated; Start-Point_X; Start-Point_Y; Start-Point_Z; End-Point_X; End-Point_Y; End-Point_Z; 
TimeStepCut_StartPoint; 
TimeStepCut_EndPoint; 
HeightAtTool_StartPoint; 
HeightAtTool_EndPoint; 
Shape_Error_StartPoint; 
Shape_Error_EndPoint; Shape_Error_Prediction_StartPoint; 
Shape_Error_Prediction_EndPoint; 
Shape_Error_Relevance_Flag_StartPoint;
Shape_Error_Relevance_Flag_EndPoint;
